## Depth Level Decision Matrix

Use this matrix to determine optimal documentation depth:

| Task Type | Recommended Depth | Stop Condition | Estimated Tokens |
|-----------|------------------|----------------|------------------|
| Quick bug fix | D0-D1 | Found component + entry point | ~2,000 |
| Complex bug fix | D1-D2 | Understand patterns | ~6,000 |
| Simple feature | D1-D2 | Have patterns + integration | ~6,000 |
| Complex feature | D2-D3 | Architecture + design | ~13,000 |
| Refactoring | D2-D3 | Patterns + dependencies | ~13,000 |
| Performance work | D3-D4 | Bottlenecks + complete API | ~25,000 |
| Architecture review | D3-D4 | Full system understanding | ~25,000 |
| Historical analysis | D4-D5 | Evolution context | ~35,000 |

