## Cross-Skill Integration

### With $DocumentationPDNavigator
Once documentation is created, agents use `$DocumentationPDNavigator` to efficiently navigate it:
```
Agent: Triggered $CreatePDDocs to build documentation
→ Creates DOCUMENTATION-HUB.md [D0]
→ Creates component docs [D1-D5]
→ Adds depth markers and stop conditions

Later: New agent uses $DocumentationPDNavigator
→ Reads DOCUMENTATION-HUB.md [D0]
→ Navigates to relevant D1 doc
→ Stops at optimal depth based on task
```

### With $ArchitectCoder
For massive codebases, `$CreatePDDocs` leverages `$ArchitectCoder`:
```
$CreatePDDocs: Needs to analyze 50+ components
→ Triggers $ArchitectCoder workflow
→ Architect: Creates analysis plan
→ Coder subagents: Analyze subsystems (via run_glm_prompt_thinking)
→ Architect: Integrates findings into PD documentation
```

### With $RelentlessWebResearch
For external documentation and best practices:
```
$CreatePDDocs: Needs framework-specific patterns
→ Triggers $RelentlessWebResearch
→ Gathers official docs, best practices
→ Integrates findings into D2-D3 documentation
```

